WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:03.135
-From Studio 6B
in Rockefeller Center

00:00:03.135 --> 00:00:04.804
in the heart of New York City,

00:00:04.804 --> 00:00:06.539
it's a special
five-minute edition

00:00:06.539 --> 00:00:09.008
of "The Tonight Show
Starring Jimmy Fallon."

00:00:09.008 --> 00:00:11.010
It's the Fallon Five!

00:00:11.010 --> 00:00:13.345 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:13.345 --> 00:00:15.681
-Welcome to the Fallon Five!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:15.681 --> 00:00:17.517
We're gonna be checking in
throughout the Olympics

00:00:17.517 --> 00:00:19.685
with five-minute mini shows
now that "The Tonight Show"

00:00:19.685 --> 00:00:22.688
is back in Studio 6B
with a full audience.

00:00:22.688 --> 00:00:25.692
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:25.692 --> 00:00:29.128
To kick things off,
it's the end of the week,

00:00:29.128 --> 00:00:30.964
and I need to catch up
with some personal stuff.

00:00:30.964 --> 00:00:32.631
I'm running a bit behind,
so if you guys wouldn't mind,

00:00:32.631 --> 00:00:34.633
I'd like to write out my weekly
thank you notes right now,

00:00:34.633 --> 00:00:36.469
if that's okay with you.
I appreciate it.

00:00:36.469 --> 00:00:37.937
Thank you very much.

00:00:37.937 --> 00:00:40.740
James, can I get some thank you
note writing music, please?

00:00:40.740 --> 00:00:46.479 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:46.479 --> 00:00:52.251 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:52.251 --> 00:00:54.387
Thank you, table tennis,

00:00:54.387 --> 00:00:57.156
for being the only Olympic sport
you can train for

00:00:57.156 --> 00:00:58.657
in your stepdad's basement.

00:00:58.657 --> 00:01:00.460
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:06.832 --> 00:01:08.334 line:0%
♪♪

00:01:08.334 --> 00:01:11.837
Thank you, Olympic precautions,
like social distancing.

00:01:11.837 --> 00:01:14.340
That's why this year's logo
went from this

00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:16.342
to this.

00:01:16.342 --> 00:01:18.378
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:24.517 --> 00:01:26.019 line:0%
♪♪

00:01:26.019 --> 00:01:28.020
Thank you, dressage,

00:01:28.020 --> 00:01:30.022
for not going by
your original name,

00:01:30.022 --> 00:01:32.024
horse prom.

00:01:32.024 --> 00:01:33.960
[ Applause ]

00:01:38.864 --> 00:01:40.366
♪♪

00:01:40.366 --> 00:01:42.535
Thank you, shot-putters,

00:01:42.535 --> 00:01:44.536
for always looking like
you're taking a phone call

00:01:44.536 --> 00:01:46.205
on a little metal ball.

00:01:46.205 --> 00:01:49.042
[ Laughter ]
Oh! Hold on.

00:01:49.042 --> 00:01:50.343
Huh?

00:01:55.981 --> 00:01:57.650
♪♪

00:01:57.650 --> 00:02:01.487
Thank you, Olympic medals made
from recycled electronics,

00:02:01.487 --> 00:02:03.656
for ensuring that
some lucky athlete

00:02:03.656 --> 00:02:06.825
is gonna wear the iPhone 4
I threw out in 2013.

00:02:06.825 --> 00:02:08.795
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:09.962 --> 00:02:11.498
I made it.

00:02:15.568 --> 00:02:17.070 line:0%
♪♪

00:02:17.070 --> 00:02:20.272
Thank you, fencing,
for being the perfect sport

00:02:20.272 --> 00:02:22.775
for beekeepers who have
always wanted to say,

00:02:22.775 --> 00:02:25.277
"You killed my father.
Now prepare to die."

00:02:25.277 --> 00:02:26.945
[ Laughter ]

00:02:26.945 --> 00:02:29.349
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:33.652 --> 00:02:35.154 line:0%
♪♪

00:02:35.154 --> 00:02:37.323
Thank you,
synchronized swimming,

00:02:37.323 --> 00:02:39.992
for basically being
underwater TikTok.

00:02:39.992 --> 00:02:42.028
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:47.500 --> 00:02:49.001 line:0%
♪♪

00:02:49.001 --> 00:02:52.372
Thank you, race walking,
for being the Olympic sport

00:02:52.372 --> 00:02:54.673
that looks like
all of the competitors

00:02:54.673 --> 00:02:56.175
just drank too much cold brew

00:02:56.175 --> 00:02:58.011
and are looking
for the nearest bathroom.

00:02:58.011 --> 00:03:00.846
Ugh! Tss, tss, eeh!

00:03:00.846 --> 00:03:02.515
Not now, not now!

00:03:02.515 --> 00:03:04.050
-Do I need a key?

00:03:07.219 --> 00:03:08.721 line:0%
♪♪

00:03:08.721 --> 00:03:10.556
-Thank you, water polo,

00:03:10.556 --> 00:03:11.891
or as I like to call you,

00:03:11.891 --> 00:03:13.726
try-not-to-drown soccer.

00:03:13.726 --> 00:03:15.394
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:15.628 --> 00:03:17.763
That's the Fallon Five!
Thank you for watching.

00:03:17.763 --> 00:03:19.765
And good luck to all
of this year's Olympians.

00:03:19.765 --> 00:03:21.767
See you tomorrow night!

00:03:21.767 --> 00:03:23.937
[ Cheers and applause ]

